   \boxed{= \sqrt{\frac{8\sqrt[3]{2} + \sqrt[3]{2} + \sqrt[3]{8}\cdot2}{\sqrt[3]{2}^3}\cdot\sqrt[3]{8}}
   }
```

Multiplying the numbers outside:

```
   \boxed{= 2\sqrt{\frac{8\sqrt[3]{2} + \sqrt[3]{2} + \sqrt[3]{8}\cdot2}{\sqrt[3]{2}^3}}
   }
```

Now we can simplify the numerator:

```
   \boxed{= 2\sqrt{\frac{8\sqrt[3]{2} + 2 + 2\sqrt[3]{2}(\sqrt[3]{8}-1)}{\sqrt[3]{2}^3}}
   }
```

We can factor out that $\sqrt[3]{2}$ from the numerator:

```
   \boxed{= 2\sqrt{\frac{\sqrt[3]{2}(8 + 2 + 2(\sqrt[3]{8}-1))}{\sqrt[3]{2}^3}}
   }
```

We can factor out $\sqrt[3]{2}$ again, this time from the denominator:

```
   \boxed{= 2\sqrt{\frac{\sqrt[3]{2}(8 + 2 + 2(\sqrt[3]{8}-1))}{\sqrt[3]{8}}}
