```

We have $\sqrt[3]8$ in the denominator but it's actually a sixth power, so we can use that:

```
   \boxed{= 2\sqrt{\frac{\sqrt[3]{2}(8 + 2 + 2(\sqrt[3]{2}-1)^2)}{\sqrt[3]{6}}}
   }
```

This simplifies the whole expression to a fraction:

```
   \boxed{= 2\sqrt{\frac{11 + 2(\sqrt[3]{2}-1)^2}{\sqrt[3]{6}}}
