   \end{equation*}
   Since $z$ lies on the unit circle, let us check its argument:
   \begin{align*}
   \theta_z&=\arg\left(-\frac{1}{2} + \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}i\right)\\
   &=\arctan\left(-\frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}\right)-\pi\\
   &\approx 103.43^\circ
